        "original_id": "b9373552-090b-5781-b5e2-5b5e023f2d75",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Public Television 19, Inc.\n- TV Stations: KCPT, KCTV\n- Radio Stations: KTBG\n- TV Programs: Check, Please!\n- Places: Kansas City, Missouri, Kansas City, Kansas, Union Hill, Blue Valley, East 31st Street, 23rd Street, Stark Avenue\n\nFacts:\n- KCPT is owned by Public Television 19, Inc.\n- KCPT maintains studio facilities on East 31st Street in the Union Hill section of Kansas City, Missouri.\n- KCPT shares its studio facilities with sister adult album alternative radio station KTBG (90.9 FM).\n- KCPT's studio facilities are adjacent to the transmitter tower of CBS affiliate KCTV.\n- KCPT's transmitter is located near 23rd Street and Stark Avenue in the Blue Valley section of Kansas City, Missouri.\n- KCTV is a CBS-affiliated television station licensed to Kansas City, Missouri, and it also serves Kansas City, Kansas.\n- KCTV broadcasts on virtual channel 5 and UHF digital channel 24.\n- Check, Please! began airing on KCPT in Kansas City in 2009.",
